---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const updated = 'August 20, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Ocala Level Pros"
  description="How Ocala Level Pros collects, uses, and protects the information you share when you request a mobile home leveling estimate."
  canonical="https://ocalalevelpros.com/privacy/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "BreadcrumbList", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://ocalalevelpros.com/"}, {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Privacy Policy", "item": "https://ocalalevelpros.com/privacy/"}]}</script>
<style is:global>
  .legal p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .legal ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .legal li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 22px; color: #16332C; margin: 36px 0 14px; }
  .legal a { color: #1F6D5A; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .legal a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #175445 0%, #1F6D5A 65%, #175445 100%);padding:60px 24px;">
  <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
    <h1 style="font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.1;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);margin:0 0 12px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);margin:0;">Last updated {updated}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:56px 24px 72px;">
  <div class="legal" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
    <p>Ocala Level Pros ("we", "us") provides mobile home leveling, tie-down, vapor barrier, and skirting services in Marion, Sumter, and Citrus counties, Florida. This policy explains what information we collect through this website and what we do with it.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only what you give us and what your browser reports automatically:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you submit.</strong> When you request an estimate, we collect your name, phone number, email address, property address or city, and whatever you tell us about your home.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage data.</strong> Google Analytics records pages viewed, approximate location, device and browser type, and how you reached the site. Your IP address is anonymized before it is stored.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How We Use It</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To contact you about the estimate you requested and to schedule work.</li>
      <li>To prepare written estimates, invoices, and any certification paperwork your insurer, lender, or inspector needs.</li>
      <li>To understand which pages people find useful so we can improve the site.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your information. We do not send marketing email unless you ask us to.</p>

    <h2>Who We Share It With</h2>
    <p>We share your information only with service providers that help us operate, and only as needed to do so:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Formspree</strong> processes estimate-request form submissions and forwards them to us by email.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> provides anonymized traffic measurement.</li>
      <li><strong>Vercel</strong> hosts this website and keeps standard server logs.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We will also disclose information where the law requires it.</p>

    <h2>Calls and Text Messages</h2>
    <p>When you call or text (352) 247-3105, we keep your number and a record of the conversation so we can follow up on your job. We do not add you to any automated marketing list.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses Google Analytics cookies to measure traffic. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or install the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>. Nothing on this site requires cookies to work.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We keep estimate requests and job records for as long as we need them for business and tax purposes, and as long as Florida law requires for licensed work. Analytics data expires on Google's standard schedule.</p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Email <a href="mailto:info@ocalalevelpros.com">info@ocalalevelpros.com</a> or call (352) 247-3105 and we will take care of it.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Ocala Level Pros<br>Ocala, Florida<br>Phone: <a href="tel:+13522473105">(352) 247-3105</a><br>Email: <a href="mailto:info@ocalalevelpros.com">info@ocalalevelpros.com</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
